      <activity id="76a71361-79b2-58e1-bb14-11d53c93de6e" activityNameId="22c1b237-9189-5f04-8b7b-50b810e0e50c" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">EV charger, level 3, plugin, 200 kW</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: EV charger, level 3, plugin, 200 kW
 Level 2 charger for BEV. From https://doi.org/10.1016/S0306-2619(01)00032-0. Used for overnight charging. Can charge a regular passenger car in 3 hours. Assumed lifetime of 24 years. We upscale it to a 100 kW Level-3 charger by upscaling the charger component given a mass of 1290 kg given by AAB's 100 kW bus charger. Original source: https://doi.org/10.1016/S0306-2619(01)00032-0. UUID: 7d61c1d5-ea08-3f81-a3cc-81ad0d64fb6e
Location: Unspecified
Technology: Level 2 charger for BEV. From https://doi.org/10.1016/S0306-2619(01)00032-0. Used for overnight charging. Can charge a regular passenger car in 3 hours. Assumed lifetime of 24 years. We upscale it to a 100 kW Level-3 charger by upscaling the charger component given a mass of 1290 kg given by AAB's 100 kW bus charger. Original source: https://doi.org/10.1016/S0306-2619(01)00032-0
Time period: Base technology year of 2020
Production volume: Unspecified
Sampling: Unspecified
Extrapolations: Unspecified
Uncertainty adjustments: Unspecified
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_7d61c1d5-ea08-3f81-a3cc-81ad0d64fb6e.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="20a9bf48-6cea-59b4-ad08-000cb981f2d0" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
